WEBVTT

00:12.530 --> 00:20.580
♪From primal chaos to the starry sky♪

00:20.580 --> 00:28.340
♪In all realms, we hold the balance♪

00:44.920 --> 00:46.940
♪The cauldron tempers divine blades♪

00:46.940 --> 00:50.810
♪The furnace refines the void♪

00:52.820 --> 00:54.930
♪The Way is in mystic fate♪

00:54.930 --> 00:58.720
♪Dare to cleave the primal chaos♪

01:36.380 --> 01:37.620
[Pull Strings]

01:37.620 --> 01:39.380
[Adapted from the novel
by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

01:39.420 --> 01:42.340
[Episode 15]

01:42.430 --> 01:43.490
Top priority right now

01:43.710 --> 01:45.690
is stopping her
from taking the Pregenesis Sword.

01:45.870 --> 01:46.850
You brat.

01:46.920 --> 01:48.130
Why does she want the sword?

01:49.200 --> 01:51.260
She wants
to take the Sea-Calming Pillar.

01:54.000 --> 01:54.900
Do you know

01:54.920 --> 01:56.260
what happens

01:56.310 --> 01:57.380
if the Sea-Calming Pillar is taken?

01:57.640 --> 01:58.900
I must have it.

02:00.070 --> 02:00.850
Why?

02:03.840 --> 02:06.050
Because someone mightier told me,

02:06.230 --> 02:07.180
soon,

02:07.200 --> 02:08.260
a world-ending Great Tribulation

02:08.280 --> 02:10.060
will descend upon the Three Realms.

02:11.960 --> 02:12.730
Fate?

02:15.400 --> 02:16.820
You've seen Fate too?

02:17.120 --> 02:18.220
How come I never saw it?

02:37.430 --> 02:40.850
Fate once told me

02:41.870 --> 02:44.780
the Three Realms would
face a Great Tribulation.

02:45.000 --> 02:47.260
All life will suffer,
barely one in ten surviving.

02:48.080 --> 02:50.890
I thought I was the only one.

02:50.910 --> 02:52.780
I'd rather never have met it

02:53.840 --> 02:55.380
or heard its warning.

02:55.400 --> 02:57.380
I wasn't even told about this.

02:57.400 --> 02:58.850
How could it tell you first?

03:00.590 --> 03:03.170
You only need to return

03:03.310 --> 03:04.450
to the Celestial Court to escape it.

03:04.470 --> 03:05.340
What are you afraid of?

03:05.360 --> 03:06.260
That makes sense.

03:06.840 --> 03:08.260
The Celestial Court is short-handed.

03:08.520 --> 03:09.660
Even so,

03:09.800 --> 03:11.100
that only saves me alone,

03:11.910 --> 03:13.500
not the entire Seizing Sect.

03:14.470 --> 03:15.290
When someone

03:16.030 --> 03:17.610
acts with no choice,

03:17.840 --> 03:20.850
she must have loved ones.

03:20.910 --> 03:22.100
You know Trifairy Isle?

03:23.080 --> 03:24.780
You think I'm doing this for myself?

03:25.680 --> 03:26.980
If it were just for myself,

03:27.520 --> 03:29.100
I could simply live freely.

03:30.080 --> 03:31.450
You're not acting for yourself,

03:31.910 --> 03:33.660
but to save the sect members?

03:34.520 --> 03:35.890
What else did Fate tell you?

03:36.030 --> 03:37.220
Fate also told me

03:38.800 --> 03:40.450
when the Great Tribulation arrives,

03:41.240 --> 03:42.570
the entire Seizing Sect

03:42.800 --> 03:44.290
will die horribly,

03:44.680 --> 03:45.690
wiped out completely.

03:46.080 --> 03:46.940
Fate also said,

03:46.960 --> 03:48.340
only by gathering
all twelve Spirit Treasures,

03:49.630 --> 03:51.100
can the entire Seizing Sect be saved.

03:52.520 --> 03:54.100
That's why you changed

03:54.120 --> 03:55.500
and seized treasures everywhere.

03:56.000 --> 03:57.220
If Fate seeks to kill me,

03:57.240 --> 03:58.410
I bear no complaint.

03:59.190 --> 04:00.340
But if Fate means

04:00.360 --> 04:02.060
to hurt my fellow disciples,

04:02.630 --> 04:03.850
even if it is my Fated Mandate,

04:04.680 --> 04:06.060
I will fight till the end.

04:07.080 --> 04:08.500
Have you ever thought,

04:09.030 --> 04:10.690
if you take the Sea-Calming Pillar,

04:11.710 --> 04:13.450
the Great Tribulation will truly begin?

04:17.510 --> 04:18.580
Though I don't know

04:18.600 --> 04:19.900
what this Great Tribulation is,

04:21.040 --> 04:23.700
a catastrophe leaving barely

04:25.070 --> 04:25.980
one in ten

04:27.310 --> 04:28.780
happened 1,000 years ago.

04:31.040 --> 04:32.020
The Deity-Demon War?

04:33.190 --> 04:35.810
Beneath the East Sea Eye,

04:36.480 --> 04:37.290
sealed by the Sea-Calming Pillar,

04:38.070 --> 04:40.050
lies the Demon Emperor, defeated then.

04:42.120 --> 04:43.250
So now you know

04:43.680 --> 04:45.850
why I can't let you take it.

04:46.510 --> 04:47.290
But what if

04:48.480 --> 04:49.810
the Great Tribulation

04:49.870 --> 04:51.250
has nothing to do with the East Sea Eye,

04:51.800 --> 04:52.490
then what could I use

04:52.510 --> 04:53.660
to save my fellow disciples?

04:53.680 --> 04:55.780
If you forcibly take it,

04:56.600 --> 04:57.370
that moment

04:57.870 --> 04:59.250
guarantees a total catastrophe.

05:03.920 --> 05:04.700
Well...

05:05.830 --> 05:07.100
I have an idea.

05:30.000 --> 05:30.660
What are you doing?

05:30.680 --> 05:31.700
Destroying it if you can't have it?

05:31.720 --> 05:33.020
Yunxiao, don't be fooled.

05:33.310 --> 05:34.100
What?

05:34.600 --> 05:35.660
Just think it over.

05:35.680 --> 05:37.490
Why did the Westdawn Sect
set up the Sea Demon scheme

05:37.510 --> 05:39.100
to find the Pregenesis Sword?

05:41.120 --> 05:42.460
For the Sea-Calming Pillar?

05:42.680 --> 05:43.700
What's the motive of the person

05:43.720 --> 05:44.850
who lured you into this?

05:44.870 --> 05:45.660
To trigger

05:46.310 --> 05:47.660
the Great Tribulation?

05:48.190 --> 05:50.100
Who lured you into this,

05:50.310 --> 05:51.410
and what do they want?

05:55.800 --> 05:58.020
To make me trigger it myself.

06:02.040 --> 06:03.810
This Great Tribulation from Fate

06:03.830 --> 06:05.810
won't appear out of nowhere.

06:05.830 --> 06:07.170
So I guess

06:08.310 --> 06:10.290
a force behind the scenes

06:10.390 --> 06:12.170
is pushing the Great Tribulation.

06:12.870 --> 06:13.810
That force

06:14.190 --> 06:15.700
is likely the Westdawn Sect.

06:16.680 --> 06:17.980
And the Celestial Court does nothing?

06:18.240 --> 06:20.490
Westdawn is a small sect in Cattle Land.

06:20.510 --> 06:21.850
Unrevealed for a millennium.

06:21.920 --> 06:22.850
Even if the Celestial Court
wants to act,

06:22.920 --> 06:24.020
they cannot locate it.

06:24.720 --> 06:26.170
Besides, the Celestial Court is new.

06:26.480 --> 06:27.370
Barely managing itself.

06:28.240 --> 06:30.220
Westdawn lay low for years

06:30.240 --> 06:31.490
just to set this trap.

06:31.630 --> 06:32.700
If my guess is right,

06:32.830 --> 06:34.780
their power isn't just on Bear Island,

06:34.800 --> 06:35.850
but also Ascendance Sect,

06:36.270 --> 06:37.170
and even Dragon Palace.

06:39.480 --> 06:41.250
When did you notice?

06:41.600 --> 06:42.580
Since I found

06:42.720 --> 06:44.900
someone eyeing the Pregenesis Sword,

06:44.920 --> 06:46.250
I had my suspicions.

06:46.310 --> 06:47.580
If so,

06:48.920 --> 06:50.020
what's your plan?

06:50.040 --> 06:51.460
Since the villagers believe in deities,

06:51.600 --> 06:54.170
why can't you and I

06:54.920 --> 06:57.610
become their deities?

07:00.160 --> 07:01.580
So at that moment,

07:01.600 --> 07:03.610
you planned to split the sword?

07:04.240 --> 07:05.250
Making up scenarios, huh?

07:05.830 --> 07:06.610
What plan?

07:08.830 --> 07:10.610
I split the sword into three pieces.

07:10.630 --> 07:12.660
One piece for each of us three.

07:13.190 --> 07:15.290
If Westdawn wants the sword,

07:15.510 --> 07:17.580
they must gather all three of us.

07:17.630 --> 07:18.460
If any one of us three

07:18.480 --> 07:19.700
meets with trouble,

07:19.720 --> 07:21.490
the other two will know.

07:21.510 --> 07:23.100
That leaves them no way to strike.

07:23.120 --> 07:24.020
Brilliant!

07:24.920 --> 07:25.700
This way,

07:26.190 --> 07:28.780
Fairy Yunxiao can't take the pillar,

07:28.920 --> 07:30.250
and the Celestial Court can rest easy.

07:32.720 --> 07:33.370
What if...

07:33.390 --> 07:36.220
What if the Great Tribulation arrives,

07:37.120 --> 07:38.900
and the Seizing Sect faces annihilation?

07:39.310 --> 07:40.220
I, Li Changshou,

07:40.390 --> 07:42.170
am willing to offer my piece.

07:44.000 --> 07:45.290
And I'll humbly ask Your Majesty

07:45.600 --> 07:47.170
to show mercy

07:47.310 --> 07:48.410
to the Seizing Sect

07:48.510 --> 07:51.100
and help you unlock
the Sea-Calming Pillar.

07:53.480 --> 07:55.490
If the Great Tribulation truly begins,

07:55.720 --> 07:57.660
whether the Eye of the Sea can be sealed

07:58.120 --> 07:59.290
hardly matters anymore.

07:59.870 --> 08:02.290
I'll lend you my full support, Fairy.

08:03.510 --> 08:04.580
What do you say, Yunxiao?

08:11.800 --> 08:12.580
So,

08:13.120 --> 08:15.100
everything you did on Bear Island

08:15.720 --> 08:16.850
was all for me?

08:18.390 --> 08:19.490
People who don't know you

08:19.800 --> 08:21.100
might get the wrong idea

08:21.240 --> 08:22.580
from what they've heard.

08:23.430 --> 08:25.290
But after being with you these days,

08:26.190 --> 08:27.490
I trust you.

08:36.510 --> 08:37.490
No one has ever

08:38.080 --> 08:39.700
dared defy me as you have.

08:39.840 --> 08:40.890
And no one has ever

08:41.390 --> 08:42.770
trusted me the way you do.

08:43.910 --> 08:44.700
You...

08:45.120 --> 08:46.610
Don't you resent me for using you?

08:46.840 --> 08:48.100
Aren't you afraid I'll trick you?

08:48.270 --> 08:49.420
If that day comes,

08:50.000 --> 08:50.700
this brat

08:51.630 --> 08:52.700
will have a plan.

08:54.120 --> 08:55.220
You brat.

08:55.600 --> 08:57.010
Always full of tricky ideas.

09:04.440 --> 09:05.220
Thank you.

09:24.260 --> 09:26.140
[Li Changshou]

09:26.140 --> 09:29.540
[Yunxiao]

09:29.910 --> 09:30.530
That's odd.

09:31.000 --> 09:32.340
Where is Ke Le'er?

09:39.240 --> 09:40.010
Everyone,

09:41.120 --> 09:42.100
I must take my leave.

09:42.390 --> 09:43.180
Grandlord.

09:43.910 --> 09:46.010
If you leave, what about us mortals?

09:46.240 --> 09:46.700
Yeah.

09:46.720 --> 09:47.370
Right.

09:47.390 --> 09:48.940
What about us?

09:48.960 --> 09:50.100
Don't worry, everyone.

09:52.080 --> 09:53.250
Though I leave,

09:54.630 --> 09:55.850
the Sea Deity Sect

09:57.240 --> 09:58.890
will carry on.

10:00.360 --> 10:01.180
Really?

10:01.440 --> 10:02.580
I hereby declare

10:02.630 --> 10:04.650
the Grandlord of the Sea Deity Sect

10:04.720 --> 10:06.700
goes to Changgeng the Great.

10:07.200 --> 10:08.010
Wonderful!

10:08.030 --> 10:08.650
Changgeng the Great.

10:08.670 --> 10:10.220
We have a new Grandlord.

10:10.550 --> 10:11.490
A new Grandlord.

10:11.510 --> 10:12.490
- Great.
- Sea Deity Sect.

10:12.510 --> 10:13.300
A new Grandlord.

10:13.320 --> 10:14.490
Let's greet the new Grandlord.

10:14.510 --> 10:15.460
Hail the new Grandlord.

10:16.150 --> 10:17.460
Hail the new Grandlord.

10:18.440 --> 10:19.610
Dumping the karma you don't want

10:19.630 --> 10:21.220
right onto me, huh?

10:21.510 --> 10:23.490
- This was your doing.
- Hail the new Grandlord.

10:23.870 --> 10:25.990
- Handle it yourself.
- Hail the new Grandlord.

10:27.070 --> 10:28.100
Hail the new Grandlord.

10:28.120 --> 10:29.490
- Hail the new Grandlord.
- I mean...

10:29.670 --> 10:32.300
- These people are already so strong.
- Hail the new Grandlord.

10:32.320 --> 10:34.700
Way stronger than ordinary people.

10:34.720 --> 10:35.890
So why still worship any deity?

10:37.240 --> 10:38.490
You haven't seen

10:38.910 --> 10:40.420
how miserably the Ancestral Witch heirs

10:42.030 --> 10:43.370
used to live.

10:44.390 --> 10:45.180
Miserably?

10:45.910 --> 10:48.850
Back then, Ancestral Witch heirs
forged the Pregenesis Sword.

10:49.360 --> 10:51.220
Fearing someone would steal it,

10:52.120 --> 10:54.650
they put a restriction on it.

10:54.670 --> 10:57.180
It must be consecrated
with an Ancestral Witch heir's blood

10:58.320 --> 10:59.980
to unleash its power.

11:01.480 --> 11:02.980
Without the blood,

11:03.030 --> 11:04.060
the sword

11:04.910 --> 11:06.890
is just an ordinary blade.

11:07.910 --> 11:09.220
Consecrated with blood?

11:11.240 --> 11:12.370
You've figured it out, right?

11:12.390 --> 11:13.490
Back then, the Demon Emperor

11:13.790 --> 11:15.700
kept the Ancestral Witch heirs captive,

11:16.120 --> 11:17.460
killing one to consecrate the sword

11:17.790 --> 11:19.650
before every campaign.

11:20.120 --> 11:21.490
The Ancestral Witch heirs

11:22.870 --> 11:24.700
were tormented for years.

11:24.870 --> 11:26.700
And these surviving villagers

11:27.840 --> 11:28.890
forgot long ago

11:29.480 --> 11:31.580
their identity as Ancestral Witch heirs,

11:33.790 --> 11:35.060
yet always remembered

11:35.270 --> 11:38.460
the fear and awe of waiting for deities

11:40.270 --> 11:41.220
to save them.

11:47.670 --> 11:49.770
Enough moping. Let's go.

11:49.790 --> 11:50.820
There are still plenty of matters

11:50.840 --> 11:51.980
for you to judge up above.

11:52.000 --> 11:52.770
Let's get moving.

11:53.270 --> 11:56.250
Why is there always so much to do?

11:58.390 --> 11:59.420
Fine, fine.

12:00.150 --> 12:00.730
Hurry.

12:00.840 --> 12:01.420
Bye.

12:09.630 --> 12:11.180
I finally got...

12:12.440 --> 12:12.940
Earth Evasion.

12:15.440 --> 12:16.300
Where is the Grandlord?

12:16.320 --> 12:17.490
Grandlord?

12:17.510 --> 12:18.100
Where is the Grandlord?

12:18.200 --> 12:18.980
Grandlord?

12:19.120 --> 12:21.650
Our Grandlord has gone.

12:21.720 --> 12:22.850
Stay calm, everyone.

12:23.200 --> 12:24.180
No one panic.

12:25.150 --> 12:25.700
Dad.

12:25.720 --> 12:27.060
- He is not. He is not.
- The Grandlord is gone.

12:27.390 --> 12:28.060
He is not.

12:29.480 --> 12:30.980
He is not the Grandlord.

12:32.200 --> 12:32.820
Then who is he?

12:32.840 --> 12:34.490
He is our Deity.

12:34.870 --> 12:35.770
Our Deity?

12:35.790 --> 12:36.890
Our Deity?

12:36.910 --> 12:38.580
We're leaving Bear Island

12:38.960 --> 12:42.850
and bringing him back!

12:42.870 --> 12:43.610
Aye.

12:44.080 --> 12:45.850
He is our Deity.

12:45.870 --> 12:46.580
Sea Deity Sect.

12:46.600 --> 12:49.820
- He is our Deity!
- Sea Deity Sect.

12:49.840 --> 12:51.850
Sea Deity Sect.

12:52.390 --> 12:53.890
As you can see from this chart,

12:53.910 --> 12:56.100
[Sea-Calming Pillar]
Westdawn targets the Sea-Calming Pillar,

12:56.120 --> 12:57.770
brewing the Great Tribulation.

12:57.790 --> 13:00.180
The core issue right now
is the Westdawn Sect.

13:00.200 --> 13:02.220
This is our biggest threat.

13:02.240 --> 13:04.100
Solve this threat,

13:04.120 --> 13:05.420
and everything gets resolved.

13:05.440 --> 13:07.300
Peaceful Three Realms from then on.

13:07.600 --> 13:09.490
Your Majesty, any questions?

13:11.510 --> 13:12.370
A few points.

13:12.720 --> 13:13.490
Go ahead.

13:13.870 --> 13:15.010
What is this chart?

13:16.480 --> 13:18.700
It's called a mind map.

13:18.720 --> 13:19.890
Where'd this red thread come from?

13:20.200 --> 13:21.940
I borrowed it from the Moon Elder.

13:22.510 --> 13:24.490
This handwriting is dreadful.

13:24.510 --> 13:25.700
Can you please get to the point?

13:25.870 --> 13:26.890
The point.

13:26.910 --> 13:27.820
I said so much.

13:27.910 --> 13:29.250
Can you focus on the point?

13:32.200 --> 13:33.850
You make it all sound neat.

13:34.670 --> 13:36.060
But as you can see,

13:36.390 --> 13:37.420
the Celestial Court now

13:38.240 --> 13:39.250
is in dire straits.

13:39.630 --> 13:40.700
And the Dragon Clan

13:41.000 --> 13:42.490
has never bowed to rule
for over a thousand years.

13:42.510 --> 13:43.850
We can't get involved.

13:44.000 --> 13:45.250
Plus the Westdawn Sect

13:46.320 --> 13:47.490
never shows its face.

13:47.510 --> 13:49.060
We can't even find them.

13:49.080 --> 13:49.890
How can we settle this?

13:51.000 --> 13:53.490
The Sea-Calming Pillar
is in the East Sea,

13:53.870 --> 13:55.650
and Westdawn has made its way in.

13:55.720 --> 13:57.770
So the key is

13:57.790 --> 14:00.100
how to use the Celestial Court's power

14:00.120 --> 14:01.100
to enter the East Sea.

14:03.910 --> 14:05.180
Any good tricks?

14:07.510 --> 14:08.610
Here.

14:10.390 --> 14:12.370
Dragon Clan ascension.

14:12.480 --> 14:14.100
Dragon Clan ascension.

14:14.120 --> 14:14.980
That's it?

14:15.000 --> 14:15.890
What does it mean?

14:17.720 --> 14:19.370
Quite simple, actually.

14:22.750 --> 14:23.530
Excuse me.

14:27.030 --> 14:28.580
I'm in a meeting. What's up?

14:29.790 --> 14:30.580
Who's that for you?

14:31.670 --> 14:32.610
Go on. Go.

14:33.790 --> 14:34.820
I wasn't talking to you.

14:36.600 --> 14:38.490
In sync. Two minds as one.

14:38.940 --> 14:42.420
[Unknown Island, South Sea]

14:46.600 --> 14:47.370
Yunxiao.

14:47.910 --> 14:50.250
The In Sync Technique is really handy.

14:50.630 --> 14:52.220
You brat. Where are you now?

14:52.240 --> 14:53.420
Just escaped from Bear Island.

14:53.440 --> 14:54.220
No wonder.

14:54.480 --> 14:56.060
[Cloud Mist Illusion]
You haven't even changed that outfit.

14:57.080 --> 14:58.420
Am I disturbing you right now?

14:58.440 --> 14:59.650
Definitely not.

14:59.670 --> 15:01.820
Not at all if it's you.

15:01.840 --> 15:03.010
Well, if that's the case,

15:03.320 --> 15:04.770
I'll come find you at Jade Division.

15:04.840 --> 15:05.420
How does that sound?

15:05.790 --> 15:06.700
No. Please don't.

15:07.390 --> 15:08.700
Dragon Clan ascension?

15:09.120 --> 15:10.490
What does that mean?

15:11.720 --> 15:13.300
Simply put,

15:13.320 --> 15:15.490
it means the Dragon Clan
joins the Celestial Court.

15:15.510 --> 15:17.820
Welcome the Celestial Court
into the Dragon Palace,

15:17.840 --> 15:20.300
and wipe out the Westdawn Sect entirely.

15:22.390 --> 15:24.460
Getting the Dragon Clan to submit

15:24.840 --> 15:25.980
is easier said than done.

15:27.030 --> 15:27.890
Actually,

15:28.270 --> 15:29.610
it's not as hard as you think.

15:30.200 --> 15:32.610
The Celestial Court needn't
rule the Dragon Clan directly.

15:32.630 --> 15:35.250
Just prop up a proxy to handle things.

15:35.390 --> 15:36.180
A proxy?

15:36.600 --> 15:38.580
If a person...

15:39.120 --> 15:40.370
If a dragon exists

15:40.720 --> 15:42.250
whom all dragons obey,

15:42.270 --> 15:43.820
while he obeys you,

15:43.840 --> 15:45.490
doesn't the ascension plan

15:46.030 --> 15:47.010
just work out?

15:47.240 --> 15:48.060
Exactly.

15:48.080 --> 15:48.820
Plus,

15:48.910 --> 15:50.580
I already found you

15:50.600 --> 15:53.010
a very fitting candidate.

15:53.270 --> 15:54.300
You even know him.

15:54.320 --> 15:55.010
Who is it?

15:56.720 --> 15:58.180
The Second Prince of East Sea.

15:58.320 --> 15:59.100
Ao Yi.

16:00.720 --> 16:01.490
Ao Yi?

16:03.120 --> 16:04.370
Do I know him?

16:15.840 --> 16:16.610
Ke Le'er

16:18.150 --> 16:19.340
is Ao Yi?

16:20.270 --> 16:21.060
Yunxiao.

16:21.320 --> 16:22.770
I was teasing you just now.

16:23.320 --> 16:25.250
I always settle debts clearly.

16:25.600 --> 16:26.700
If you trick me,

16:26.750 --> 16:28.100
I won't let you off.

16:28.600 --> 16:30.490
But you helped me
find the Pregenesis Sword,

16:30.750 --> 16:32.300
so I must repay you.

16:32.910 --> 16:33.770
Repay me?

16:34.080 --> 16:34.850
What?

16:35.000 --> 16:36.250
Am I ungrateful

16:36.550 --> 16:38.580
to you?

16:38.670 --> 16:40.100
No, never.

16:40.390 --> 16:41.980
I know you.

16:42.150 --> 16:44.340
You never want Karma.

16:44.600 --> 16:46.530
You'd rather keep all things

16:46.550 --> 16:47.940
far from you.

16:48.270 --> 16:49.340
You sure know me.

16:51.360 --> 16:52.180
Back then,

16:52.200 --> 16:54.130
when I sought an Innate Treasure,

16:54.390 --> 16:57.100
I learned that the Ancestor of the Styx

16:57.120 --> 16:58.100
had two swords:

16:58.120 --> 16:59.980
Avici and Genesis.

17:00.360 --> 17:01.980
They took lives without catching karma.

17:02.200 --> 17:03.530
Shall I snatch them for you?

17:03.670 --> 17:04.420
No, no.

17:04.440 --> 17:05.050
Please don't.

17:05.070 --> 17:06.290
Do you prefer the red one or white one?

17:06.310 --> 17:07.220
It's alright.

17:07.240 --> 17:08.570
Forget it.

17:11.400 --> 17:12.180
It's nothing.

17:13.510 --> 17:14.290
Official Li.

17:14.310 --> 17:14.980
Yes.

17:15.310 --> 17:17.290
If you can make this happen,

17:17.310 --> 17:18.980
that would be a great deed.

17:19.000 --> 17:21.900
Ascend straight to the Celestial Court
among immortals.

17:21.960 --> 17:22.730
Really?

17:25.550 --> 17:26.330
However,

17:26.640 --> 17:29.050
if you just talk big

17:29.880 --> 17:31.420
and fail to deliver,

17:32.270 --> 17:34.290
that's deceiving the Emperor.

17:35.440 --> 17:36.900
You'll face punishment.

17:37.070 --> 17:38.490
Your Majesty, rest assured.

17:38.920 --> 17:39.900
Leave it to me.

17:39.920 --> 17:40.530
Good.

17:41.310 --> 17:42.900
Fate keeps bringing us together.

17:43.590 --> 17:44.490
I've made up my mind.

17:45.200 --> 17:46.700
I'm rewarding you right now.

17:47.310 --> 17:48.010
With what?

17:51.270 --> 17:52.250
I recently

17:53.200 --> 17:55.050
finished a new painting.

17:57.480 --> 17:58.250
Never mind.

17:59.880 --> 18:01.140
Didn't I see it on Bear Island?

18:01.160 --> 18:02.620
No need to look again.

18:03.270 --> 18:04.460
This one's different.

18:04.720 --> 18:07.090
Trust me, it's truly different.

18:07.110 --> 18:09.090
You like neither Avici nor Genesis.

18:09.510 --> 18:10.380
There's someone

18:10.400 --> 18:12.420
who doesn't care about treasure?

18:12.510 --> 18:14.010
Yunxiao, you misunderstood.

18:14.510 --> 18:17.490
Winning your smile

18:17.720 --> 18:20.420
beats all treasures in the world.

18:21.830 --> 18:24.380
No one has ever said that to me.

18:25.640 --> 18:26.420
Fine.

18:26.590 --> 18:27.980
Since you like

18:28.000 --> 18:29.460
no treasures at all,

18:29.590 --> 18:31.460
how about I play you a song?

18:32.350 --> 18:33.140
Really?

18:37.720 --> 18:38.900
If you keep saying no,

18:39.480 --> 18:40.700
I'm going to get upset.

18:41.110 --> 18:42.810
Thank you for your kindness.

18:42.880 --> 18:45.810
I humbly accept.

18:46.110 --> 18:47.010
My good official.

18:47.680 --> 18:49.900
I knew you wanted to see it all along.

18:50.790 --> 18:52.250
No, that's not it. I just...

18:52.270 --> 18:54.490
This painting is totally different.

18:54.720 --> 18:56.010
If you dare to back out,

18:56.310 --> 18:57.290
may the punishment find you.

19:06.510 --> 19:07.090
Fine.

19:08.110 --> 19:09.860
Thank you for the gift, Your Majesty.

19:10.110 --> 19:10.660
Don't mention it.

19:12.270 --> 19:13.570
Oh, Li Changshou.

19:13.590 --> 19:15.290
You're so lucky.

19:15.310 --> 19:17.220
Great Immortals' artworks

19:17.310 --> 19:19.090
carry the wisdom they attained.

19:19.110 --> 19:20.420
Comprehend the Resonance,

19:20.440 --> 19:21.420
and your power will spike,

19:21.440 --> 19:23.220
saving you centuries of cultivation.

19:23.240 --> 19:24.700
How I envy you.

20:13.400 --> 20:16.290
♪Once a drifting weed, I loved to roam♪

20:16.290 --> 20:18.540
♪Now, a levee holds back the storm♪

20:18.800 --> 20:21.960
♪Fight against fate for my life♪

20:22.030 --> 20:22.730
That's not good.

20:23.310 --> 20:24.290
He can't handle it.

20:24.310 --> 20:26.090
Come on, man.

20:27.370 --> 20:29.490
♪Trekking far and wide♪

20:29.490 --> 20:32.600
♪Silent in subtleties♪

20:32.920 --> 20:35.570
♪The task descends on me♪

20:35.570 --> 20:41.860
♪Though millions hinder, it resounds♪

20:41.860 --> 20:47.350
♪Transcending gods and demons above♪

20:47.350 --> 20:47.980
♪Plain and unremarkable♪

20:47.980 --> 20:49.020
♪From the start, plan for storms♪

20:49.020 --> 20:49.950
♪Seek refuge, survive, hide my skill♪

20:49.950 --> 20:51.370
♪If smooth, seek peace♪

20:51.370 --> 20:52.710
♪If tough, stay still;
who fates good and evil♪

20:52.710 --> 20:53.980
♪After hardship, sweetness comes♪

20:53.980 --> 20:55.500
♪Set the plan before you drink♪

20:55.500 --> 20:56.960
♪Mad ones, why cut their foundation♪

20:56.960 --> 20:58.270
♪The evil knows no shame♪

20:58.270 --> 20:59.550
♪Immortal trials burn cowardice away♪

20:59.550 --> 21:00.810
♪The howling wind calls to me♪

21:00.810 --> 21:02.140
♪Gouging eyes
to light the night and ferry souls♪

21:02.140 --> 21:03.670
♪My soul is standing like a mountain♪

21:03.670 --> 21:05.350
♪Arrows in flesh as the string♪

21:05.350 --> 21:07.000
♪Chaos births a flowing ode♪

21:07.000 --> 21:08.870
♪Standing tall, heart hides its might♪

21:08.870 --> 21:11.240
♪Today my name reaches heaven♪

21:11.550 --> 21:12.180
Oh no.

21:12.640 --> 21:13.420
Too much Spiritual Energy?

21:14.540 --> 21:16.390
♪Dragon reborn breaks the chains♪

21:16.390 --> 21:17.880
♪Rising to the primal wild♪

21:17.880 --> 21:20.950
♪With firm resolve, I roam the sky♪

21:20.950 --> 21:21.850
♪Under crushing weight♪

21:21.850 --> 21:23.030
♪Wings lift toward clear skies♪

21:23.030 --> 21:24.810
My Spiritual Energy is maxed out.

21:24.810 --> 21:26.260
♪Spawning endless heavenly troops♪

21:26.260 --> 21:27.320
♪Charging against the wind♪

21:27.320 --> 21:28.830
♪Old scars reveal the truth♪

21:28.830 --> 21:29.620
♪Even if all brave men fall♪

21:29.620 --> 21:30.910
♪Chugging the murky wine♪

21:31.310 --> 21:32.050
This is...

21:54.480 --> 21:55.250
[Yuan Ze]
Something's off.

21:55.270 --> 21:56.830
[Grand Immortal of Seizing Sect]
It was calm just a moment ago.

21:56.830 --> 21:57.640
[Lord of Turtle Island]

21:57.640 --> 22:00.220
Now it's gone dark and the sea's raging?

22:01.880 --> 22:03.460
[Hanzhi, Turtle Island disciple]
Mentor, say less.

22:03.480 --> 22:04.660
Come help me.

22:11.070 --> 22:12.010
Tribulation Clouds.

22:12.880 --> 22:14.660
A cultivator's about to be tested.

22:14.940 --> 22:15.980
[Cansheng, Turtle Island disciple]
Tribulation Clouds...

22:21.200 --> 22:22.420
You brat.

22:22.790 --> 22:24.730
You've been hiding
so much Spiritual Energy?

22:30.680 --> 22:32.330
I'm not quite ready,

22:32.480 --> 22:33.860
but I have to go through with it.

22:34.480 --> 22:35.620
There's no turning back now.

22:48.200 --> 22:48.980
Hanzhi,

22:49.440 --> 22:50.010
listen to me.

22:50.030 --> 22:51.380
Most cultivators are lucky

22:51.400 --> 22:53.330
to get through two or three strikes.

22:53.480 --> 22:55.770
Back in my day, I had four.

22:56.070 --> 22:57.460
It was extremely uncommon.

22:58.070 --> 22:59.940
So how many are in these clouds now?

23:03.590 --> 23:06.460
One, two, three...

23:11.920 --> 23:13.530
Could it be the Eightfold
Immortal-Summoning Tribulation,

23:13.550 --> 23:15.460
one of the Thirty-Two Dire Tribulations?

23:17.400 --> 23:19.220
From the Thirty-Two Dire Tribulations?

23:19.270 --> 23:19.810
Yes.

23:20.640 --> 23:23.620
This kind of Tribulation is deadly.

23:23.960 --> 23:25.010
Most who face it

23:25.030 --> 23:26.570
will be destroyed, body and soul.

23:27.480 --> 23:28.570
The Eightfold
Immortal-Summoning Tribulation

23:28.590 --> 23:30.460
ranks fourth among
the Thirty-Two Dire Tribulations.

23:30.480 --> 23:32.090
Only cultivators with extreme talent

23:32.110 --> 23:33.420
will face this kind of Tribulation.

23:34.790 --> 23:35.730
What a shame.

23:36.480 --> 23:38.140
A genius prodigy like me

23:38.200 --> 23:40.050
is doomed to fall in the South Sea.

23:40.440 --> 23:42.250
Mentor, could your calculations be off?

23:44.680 --> 23:45.980
I, Yuan Ze,

23:46.030 --> 23:47.770
knowing all, past and present,

23:47.790 --> 23:49.460
dubbed the Three Realms Know-It-All.

23:49.480 --> 23:50.180
Impossible.

23:50.440 --> 23:51.860
I do not make mistakes.

23:52.640 --> 23:54.460
Three Realms Know-It-All?

23:54.640 --> 23:56.330
More like a Jinx-It-All.

23:57.550 --> 23:58.460
What did you say?

23:59.480 --> 24:01.050
What if he survives it?

24:02.070 --> 24:04.810
The Thirty-Two Dire Tribulations
aren't that easy.

24:06.240 --> 24:07.460
I'll bet you.

24:07.680 --> 24:09.050
If he survives safely,

24:09.400 --> 24:10.220
I, Yuan Ze,

24:11.070 --> 24:12.530
will never speak again.

24:13.160 --> 24:15.250
Your spit is all over my face.

24:22.880 --> 24:23.940
Tingly.

24:24.550 --> 24:26.140
Feels pretty good, actually.

24:34.380 --> 24:37.070
[Mage Birdcage]

24:37.070 --> 24:38.700
Thanks, Lord Tribulation,

24:38.750 --> 24:41.700
for taking time to strike me.

24:46.590 --> 24:47.250
Hanzhi.

24:47.550 --> 24:48.490
Did you see that?

24:48.640 --> 24:49.940
The majestic lightning

24:49.960 --> 24:52.940
is Fate testing cultivators.

24:53.110 --> 24:54.050
If you make it through

24:54.350 --> 24:55.980
it's a smooth immortal path.

24:56.480 --> 24:57.460
If you don't...

24:58.160 --> 24:59.620
- Fourth strike already.
- Charred bones.

25:01.110 --> 25:02.050
Back in my day,

25:02.070 --> 25:03.940
amidst the lightning strikes,

25:03.960 --> 25:04.940
inspiration struck,

25:04.960 --> 25:05.700
so I gained

25:05.720 --> 25:07.010
supreme cultivation.

25:07.030 --> 25:08.140
- Fifth.
- Mentor.

25:08.160 --> 25:09.700
- He's passed you.
- Don't interrupt.

25:13.750 --> 25:15.380
Cansheng, what's wrong?

25:38.750 --> 25:40.420
The seventh strike.

25:42.720 --> 25:44.250
I've weathered

25:45.110 --> 25:47.220
all the strikes.

25:48.720 --> 25:50.140
As for this eighth strike,

25:51.400 --> 25:53.860
I'll take it full force.

26:09.270 --> 26:09.770
Open!

26:09.900 --> 26:12.260
[Sky-Shock Seal]

26:15.360 --> 26:17.520
♪I know the world's full of deceit♪

26:17.730 --> 26:19.990
♪Put on a good show♪

26:20.510 --> 26:24.620
♪Why not change forms and play♪

26:26.160 --> 26:27.420
Sky-Shock Seal?

26:28.350 --> 26:30.330
Who just said he'd fail?

26:30.350 --> 26:31.290
Changed your mind?

26:31.350 --> 26:32.330
No way.

26:32.350 --> 26:33.570
He's doomed now.

26:34.030 --> 26:35.250
You can't use a talisman formation

26:35.510 --> 26:37.570
to withstand a Tribulation.

26:37.920 --> 26:39.180
That is a truth

26:39.200 --> 26:41.530
proved by our forebears
with their lives.

26:41.960 --> 26:42.940
What happens if it's used?

26:42.960 --> 26:43.460
Use it, and...

26:45.070 --> 26:46.420
Even I wouldn't know.

26:49.200 --> 26:50.010
What?

26:50.160 --> 26:50.980
Stop staring at me.

26:51.000 --> 26:53.090
I haven't tried it. How would I know?

26:53.400 --> 26:55.140
The elders warned us.

26:55.160 --> 26:56.140
There must be a reason.

26:57.690 --> 26:59.070
♪Acting like fierce demons♪

26:59.070 --> 27:00.180
That cultivator

27:00.550 --> 27:02.940
outsmarted himself.

27:05.510 --> 27:07.330
Man proposes.

27:08.750 --> 27:10.250
Heaven disposes.

27:10.550 --> 27:11.460
Bring it on!

27:11.460 --> 27:16.150
♪I'll storm the array
and stir things up♪

27:25.790 --> 27:27.860
Such a shame.

27:28.640 --> 27:29.940
Another gifted cultivator

27:29.960 --> 27:31.770
perished in his own Tribulation.

27:46.750 --> 27:48.860
Refined by eight strikes of lightning,

27:49.960 --> 27:51.050
my body

27:51.880 --> 27:53.570
is finally perfected.

27:55.110 --> 27:56.330
If I reach the Celestial Court,

27:57.160 --> 27:58.570
I've got some backing now.

28:10.160 --> 28:11.180
Hold on. Hold on.

28:11.310 --> 28:12.620
My lower half isn't done yet.

28:14.440 --> 28:15.220
What happened?

28:15.920 --> 28:17.290
Is the lightning too weak?

28:17.310 --> 28:18.860
Or is my foundation too solid?

28:18.880 --> 28:20.140
Eight strikes couldn't break me.

28:20.640 --> 28:21.460
What now?

28:21.640 --> 28:22.490
Cut off my lower half

28:22.510 --> 28:23.530
so my upper half can ascend?

28:24.270 --> 28:25.570
But my lower half matters too.

28:28.550 --> 28:29.810
Could it be my disguise?

28:30.350 --> 28:31.940
Has it confused Fate's judgment?

28:37.160 --> 28:37.980
Recognize me?

28:38.830 --> 28:39.620
That doesn't work.

28:41.200 --> 28:42.220
Could it be the props?

28:43.160 --> 28:44.380
Props aren't allowed?

28:44.790 --> 28:45.900
Wait, wait.

28:46.030 --> 28:46.660
Wait.

28:47.940 --> 28:48.980
[Shroud of Fire-Bringer]

28:51.500 --> 28:53.060
[Yan Emperor's Jade]

28:55.460 --> 28:57.900
[Fuxi's Oracle Shell]

28:59.640 --> 29:00.290
There's more.

29:14.590 --> 29:16.330
This is the Divine-Demon Tribulation.

29:17.000 --> 29:18.250
The Divine-Demon Tribulation?

29:18.750 --> 29:21.380
Yes, ranked second among the Thirty-Two

29:21.400 --> 29:23.180
Dire Tribulations.

29:23.480 --> 29:25.490
You said it was the Eightfold
Immortal-Summoning Tribulation.

29:25.960 --> 29:28.570
I wish I was wrong.

29:29.110 --> 29:32.490
The Divine-Demon Tribulation
is horrifying.

29:33.400 --> 29:35.330
Throughout history, only one person

29:35.350 --> 29:36.460
has ever survived it.

29:36.480 --> 29:37.090
Who was it?

29:37.720 --> 29:39.220
The first disciple of the Human Sect.

29:39.510 --> 29:41.220
The Grand Mage of Voidcity.

29:48.160 --> 29:49.770
How long ago was that?

29:51.200 --> 29:52.330
A thousand years?

29:54.200 --> 29:55.530
Two thousand?

29:59.310 --> 30:00.290
Not my problem.

30:00.440 --> 30:01.570
Seriously.

30:03.750 --> 30:05.530
Your disciple's formation

30:06.000 --> 30:08.250
took Ling'e days to break.

30:11.550 --> 30:12.530
Mentor, Uncle.

30:12.680 --> 30:13.250
Enjoy.

30:13.270 --> 30:13.700
All right.

30:14.720 --> 30:15.380
Ling'e.

30:19.590 --> 30:20.380
Mentor.

30:21.640 --> 30:22.980
Changshou went to visit kin?

30:25.110 --> 30:25.900
Yeah.

30:26.550 --> 30:28.140
Which kin did he visit?

30:28.400 --> 30:29.180
Well...

30:29.640 --> 30:31.180
He never told me.

30:32.000 --> 30:33.380
Does he even have kin?

30:34.750 --> 30:36.290
He doesn't?

30:36.750 --> 30:38.700
I found him and took him in.

30:40.920 --> 30:41.660
Mentor, I remember.

30:41.680 --> 30:42.490
I left some soup behind.

30:42.510 --> 30:43.140
Wait for me.

30:43.160 --> 30:44.220
Ling'e.

30:44.590 --> 30:45.860
This Li Changshou...

30:46.750 --> 30:47.730
Full of lies.

30:47.750 --> 30:48.660
He knew

30:48.720 --> 30:49.810
after trapping you so long,

30:49.830 --> 30:50.810
he feared your anger,

30:50.830 --> 30:51.700
and dared not return.

30:54.680 --> 30:56.420
He'll be back in two days.

30:56.830 --> 30:57.700
Let him be.

30:57.720 --> 30:59.460
Let him be?

30:59.830 --> 31:01.290
You gotta discipline him.

31:01.550 --> 31:03.140
If this were Griefbane Division,

31:03.160 --> 31:04.730
Mentor would have already...

31:05.000 --> 31:06.290
Alright.

31:06.310 --> 31:07.140
Speak less.

31:07.160 --> 31:09.460
Have some braised pork to recover.

31:13.590 --> 31:14.810
You just accept this?

31:15.750 --> 31:16.940
My Jade Division

31:17.350 --> 31:18.940
only has these two disciples.

31:18.960 --> 31:20.940
Just a little naughty.

31:21.200 --> 31:21.980
True.

31:22.830 --> 31:23.810
This Jade Division

31:25.000 --> 31:26.010
is truly tough.

31:30.270 --> 31:31.050
Senior.

31:32.200 --> 31:33.050
I...

31:33.310 --> 31:35.250
I have a favor to ask.

31:36.880 --> 31:38.420
Why so formal now?

31:38.830 --> 31:39.730
Just say it.

31:40.240 --> 31:42.050
Look at my two disciples.

31:42.790 --> 31:44.940
Top-tier immortal seedlings.

31:44.960 --> 31:45.620
They are.

31:46.030 --> 31:47.620
Pity that as their Mentor,

31:47.680 --> 31:49.330
I have no achievements.

31:49.590 --> 31:50.380
I...

31:51.830 --> 31:52.770
Why bring that up?

31:52.790 --> 31:54.140
All past history.

31:54.350 --> 31:55.220
Don't blame yourself.

31:56.960 --> 31:57.770
What I mean is,

32:00.200 --> 32:01.420
for these two kids,

32:01.440 --> 32:02.980
if Tribulation befalls them...

32:03.350 --> 32:05.140
I mean if...

32:06.680 --> 32:07.940
May I ask you

32:10.240 --> 32:11.220
to help them out?

32:12.590 --> 32:13.380
That's it?

32:15.720 --> 32:17.050
Thought it was a big deal.

32:17.070 --> 32:18.330
We're fellow disciples,

32:18.350 --> 32:20.180
helping is natural, right?

32:22.160 --> 32:23.660
But your Jade Division

32:23.680 --> 32:24.730
truly has hardship.

32:26.550 --> 32:27.460
How about this?

32:27.750 --> 32:29.860
All three of you just move

32:30.160 --> 32:32.140
to our Griefbane Division.

32:32.240 --> 32:33.620
Then I will

32:33.960 --> 32:35.490
discipline them for you.

32:35.880 --> 32:36.660
No.

32:37.750 --> 32:39.620
Looking down on us?

32:47.160 --> 32:49.010
I am waiting

32:49.750 --> 32:50.570
for someone.

32:50.960 --> 32:51.940
Waiting for someone?

32:54.240 --> 32:54.900
Senior sister?

33:00.110 --> 33:01.530
It's been so many years.

33:01.550 --> 33:02.980
She's definitely not coming back.

33:03.270 --> 33:04.050
Nonsense!

33:04.960 --> 33:06.380
My senior sister will be back.

33:06.400 --> 33:07.220
She told me herself.

33:07.270 --> 33:08.140
She went out to cultivate.

33:08.160 --> 33:09.090
And when she returns,

33:09.110 --> 33:10.570
she'll amaze the Ascendance Sect.

33:10.590 --> 33:11.900
She's coming back.

33:12.960 --> 33:13.770
You're talking nonsense.

33:20.480 --> 33:21.900
What a massive Tribulation Cloud.

33:22.350 --> 33:25.010
Could this be
the Divine-Demon Tribulation?

33:28.030 --> 33:28.810
Senior Sister.

33:34.750 --> 33:35.940
The Tribulation met a glitch.

33:35.960 --> 33:37.140
Fate forbids props.

33:37.310 --> 33:38.420
Bear with it for a moment.

33:48.960 --> 33:51.090
It's my first. I didn't know the rules.

33:51.310 --> 33:52.940
I truly meant no deception.

33:52.960 --> 33:55.810
Please pity my hard cultivation

33:55.830 --> 33:57.660
and strike me once more.

34:03.920 --> 34:05.860
Why is there a dragon joining in now?

34:09.760 --> 34:10.980
Does it have to be right now?

34:20.960 --> 34:22.980
Good thing I prepared
extra paper puppets.

34:31.070 --> 34:32.690
Does it have to be right now?

34:38.440 --> 34:39.210
It's over.

34:45.630 --> 34:46.690
Cansheng.

34:46.710 --> 34:48.610
A little help here.

34:57.070 --> 34:58.050
The Spiritual Energy

34:58.070 --> 34:59.570
is converging toward him.

35:06.800 --> 35:07.690
First one

35:07.710 --> 35:09.530
since the Grand Mage himself.

35:10.630 --> 35:11.690
Senior Sister.

35:12.670 --> 35:13.860
Could it be you?

35:58.160 --> 36:00.260
Thank you, Fate.

36:04.590 --> 36:05.490
Little golden dragon,

36:05.990 --> 36:08.730
feeling weak all over,

36:09.270 --> 36:11.660
dizzy and lightheaded now?

36:14.000 --> 36:15.980
On that paper puppet,

36:16.270 --> 36:18.570
I put ten times the Softspirit Powder.

36:20.240 --> 36:21.380
Wanna know

36:22.150 --> 36:24.500
my power post-Tribulation?

36:29.150 --> 36:30.980
Washing Machine Vortex Crush.

37:03.280 --> 37:03.900
Cansheng?

37:03.920 --> 37:05.460
Good thing I have Cansheng.

37:05.710 --> 37:06.090
Cansheng?

37:06.110 --> 37:07.170
With an incomplete soul,

37:07.360 --> 37:09.260
he's immune to pain, fire, and water.

37:09.360 --> 37:11.170
Isn't that why you took him in?

37:11.190 --> 37:12.170
Watch your tongue.

37:12.440 --> 37:14.090
I saw potential in him.

37:14.630 --> 37:16.130
Whatever he suffered,

37:16.150 --> 37:17.820
our Seizing Sect motto

37:17.840 --> 37:19.530
is education without discrimination.

37:19.550 --> 37:21.010
You just couldn't
find a worthy disciple.

37:21.030 --> 37:23.050
So you go around picking up strays.

37:23.630 --> 37:25.340
Young lady, mind how you speak.

37:25.360 --> 37:25.900
I owe you nothing.

37:25.920 --> 37:27.460
Alright, alright.

37:29.280 --> 37:30.050
What

37:31.320 --> 37:32.090
is this place?

37:34.030 --> 37:34.820
Well,

37:38.800 --> 37:40.740
if my reading is correct,

37:41.150 --> 37:41.740
this is the Tribulation ground

37:41.760 --> 37:43.610
of that cultivator just now.

37:43.710 --> 37:44.940
So that cultivator,

37:45.190 --> 37:47.420
did he succeed or die?

37:54.760 --> 37:56.050
Stop pretending.

38:01.960 --> 38:03.740
Such strong Spiritual Energy.

38:04.360 --> 38:05.170
Fellow cultivator.

38:05.280 --> 38:06.300
I must meet you.

38:06.320 --> 38:07.090
Fellow cultivator.

38:07.400 --> 38:08.210
Fellow cultivator.

38:08.670 --> 38:09.490
Fellow cultivator.

38:09.960 --> 38:10.820
Fellow cultivator.

38:11.670 --> 38:12.460
Fellow cultivator.

38:12.760 --> 38:14.780
Please don't go.

38:19.360 --> 38:21.170
Even washed you down
to a miniature size.

38:23.290 --> 38:25.000
♪I don't ask, too lazy to fight♪

38:25.000 --> 38:26.650
I must wash away

38:26.670 --> 38:29.170
your memories of my Tribulation.

38:29.680 --> 38:31.650
♪Who sings and drinks free♪

38:31.930 --> 38:34.020
♪The stars smile at fireflies♪

38:34.230 --> 38:36.330
♪Roaming the city with reckless courage♪

38:36.330 --> 38:38.510
♪Just watching swordplay while drunk♪

38:38.510 --> 38:40.140
♪And in dreams, I reign supreme♪

38:40.530 --> 38:42.400
♪Who can ever♪

38:42.400 --> 38:44.500
♪Predict the clock of time♪

38:44.960 --> 38:46.530
This is a tough spot.

38:48.150 --> 38:48.940
No worries.

38:49.070 --> 38:50.610
Switching to Deep Clean mode.

38:51.630 --> 38:53.700
♪Let the answer be empty♪

38:53.700 --> 38:54.900
♪A varied life♪

38:55.030 --> 38:55.650
There we go.

38:55.650 --> 38:57.910
♪In all these myriad ways♪

38:58.110 --> 39:00.270
♪I drink the breeze that comes my way♪

39:00.270 --> 39:02.220
♪The steadiest surge of all♪

39:02.550 --> 39:04.760
♪I grasp the vast firmament♪

39:04.760 --> 39:06.630
♪Karma never falls empty♪

39:06.840 --> 39:08.150
♪Let the thoughts weigh♪

39:08.150 --> 39:09.940
Washed spotless.

39:11.330 --> 39:12.380
♪Unruly♪

39:12.380 --> 39:14.630
♪A carefree smile♪

39:14.630 --> 39:16.050
That should settle everything.

39:16.360 --> 39:17.940
Your Spiritual Energy is gone.

39:17.960 --> 39:18.460
From now on,

39:18.880 --> 39:20.380
begin your cultivation anew.

39:22.440 --> 39:23.860
Next up,

39:24.230 --> 39:26.940
return to the Ascendance Sect
to find Ao Yi,

39:27.000 --> 39:28.860
help him awaken his Dragon's Prophecy

39:29.360 --> 39:31.050
so he can lead the Dragon Clan

39:31.320 --> 39:32.340
to their ascension.

39:34.590 --> 39:36.610
Luckily the Pregenesis Sword
is retrieved too.

39:50.800 --> 39:51.690
This is an illusion.

39:56.510 --> 39:58.050
Not an illusion!

39:59.590 --> 40:01.490
I actually gave the Second Prince

40:01.510 --> 40:02.530
the full spa treatment,

40:02.550 --> 40:03.980
and washed away his Spiritual Energy.

40:04.150 --> 40:05.130
What to do?

40:06.840 --> 40:07.740
I'm done for. Done for.

40:11.070 --> 40:12.460
Fellow cultivator.

40:13.960 --> 40:15.340
Fellow cultivator.

40:16.000 --> 40:16.820
Fellow cultivator.

40:16.840 --> 40:18.130
You have a sharp nose, huh?

40:19.320 --> 40:20.130
Fellow cultivator.

40:21.190 --> 40:22.210
Try some Nose-Duller.

40:22.960 --> 40:23.900
Fellow cultivator.

40:23.920 --> 40:25.690
Wait up.

40:26.000 --> 40:26.860
Fellow cultivator.

40:27.190 --> 40:27.980
Fellow cultivator.

40:28.150 --> 40:29.210
Fellow cultivator.

40:30.230 --> 40:30.980
Fellow cultivator.

40:31.000 --> 40:31.740
Fellow cultivator.

40:31.960 --> 40:33.820
Why the hurry?

40:34.840 --> 40:36.690
Why won't you wait for me?

40:37.800 --> 40:39.050
Mentor, honestly.

40:39.190 --> 40:40.940
Why insist on befriending him?

40:43.280 --> 40:44.940
The Divine-Demon Tribulation.

40:45.760 --> 40:46.530
It ranks second

40:46.550 --> 40:49.130
in the Primordial World.

40:49.800 --> 40:51.690
He must be
an ancient mighty figure reborn.

40:51.710 --> 40:54.170
Only then could he survive it, right?

40:55.110 --> 40:56.940
I am Three Realms Know-It-All.

40:57.030 --> 40:58.610
Why can't I befriend him? Why?

40:58.760 --> 41:00.050
If I can't have
heart-to-heart talks with him,

41:00.510 --> 41:02.740
how can I live up to my reputation?

41:04.710 --> 41:06.300
Mentor, come over here.

41:08.320 --> 41:09.300
Someone's in there.

41:09.510 --> 41:11.130
Obviously.

41:11.150 --> 41:12.740
If you're Know-It-All,

41:12.880 --> 41:14.090
do you know who this is?

41:15.400 --> 41:17.130
Of course I do.

41:17.190 --> 41:19.210
As Three Realms Know-It-All,

41:19.280 --> 41:20.820
who could I possibly not know?

41:57.550 --> 42:03.330
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

42:04.000 --> 42:10.700
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

42:12.230 --> 42:18.280
♪Alas, love has many twists and turns♪

42:18.910 --> 42:25.360
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

42:26.100 --> 42:33.220
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

42:33.600 --> 42:40.500
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

42:40.880 --> 42:48.230
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

42:48.230 --> 42:55.400
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪

43:11.540 --> 43:16.710
♪Down a few more cups of wine♪

43:17.800 --> 43:24.820
♪Through land and sea,
I ask you to come♪

43:26.010 --> 43:31.950
♪For honor's sake, upright and grand♪

43:32.650 --> 43:39.730
♪Alas, our story is short♪

43:40.070 --> 43:47.180
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

43:47.500 --> 43:53.980
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

43:54.760 --> 44:01.970
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

44:02.360 --> 44:10.180
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪
